    "detailed_description": "Sagittarius is a classic side scrolling space shoot'em up in a modern take. In this epic space game it's up to you to save our solar system from destruction. Fly alone or with a friend in a local multiplayer co-op game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapons &amp; Power-ups</h2>Chose to upgrade your ship with either heavier armor or faster engine to suit your style of play. Overcome your enemies with the help of a wide arsenal of powerful weapons &amp; power-ups!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Minions &amp; Bosses</h2>Test your powers against a wide selection of minions and engage in epic boss fights!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hard mode</h2>Is the game too easy? Try the <strong>impossible</strong> hard mode!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Local multiplayer co-op</h2>Enjoy the full game with a friend in local multiplayer co-op. <i>NOTE: Two (2) controllers are required to play a local multiplayer game. </i>",
